flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Create[Requester creates change request]
    Create --> Valid{Input valid?}
    Valid -- No --> Fix[Show errors] --> Create
    Valid -- Yes --> Submitted[Status: Submitted]
    Submitted --> Review[Reviewer starts review]
    Review --> Decide{Approve?}
    Decide -- No --> Reason[Reviewer enters rejection reason] --> Rejected[Status: Rejected] --> End([End])
    Decide -- Yes --> Approved[Status: Approved]
    Approved --> Assign[Reviewer assigns an active engineer]
    Assign --> Assigned[Status: Assigned]
    Assigned --> StartWork[Engineer starts work]
    StartWork --> InProgress[Status: In Progress]
    InProgress --> Work[Engineer works and adds notes]
    Work --> Resolve[Engineer resolves with summary]
    Resolve --> Resolved[Status: Resolved]
    Resolved --> Check{Requester satisfied?}
    Check -- Yes --> Closed[Status: Closed] --> End
    Check -- No --> Reopen[Requester reopens with reason]
    Reopen --> Reopened[Status: Reopened] --> InProgress
